RUN apk add --no-cache ca-certificates \
    && update-ca-certificates \
    && yarn config set registry "http://registry.yarnpkg.com" \
    && DISABLE_HUSKY=1 yarn install --network-timeout 600000



✅ Solution 2 (Quick Fix for Corporate Network)

Disable strict SSL in yarn.

Modify the command:

RUN yarn config set strict-ssl false \
    && yarn config set registry "http://registry.yarnpkg.com" \
    && DISABLE_HUSKY=1 yarn install --network-timeout 600000
✅ Solution 3 (If Behind Proxy)

If your company uses a proxy:

Add to Dockerfile:

ENV NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0
